ntation(\"org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-web\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    runtimeOnly(\"com.mysql:mysql-connector-j\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    testImplementation(\"org.springframework.boot:spring-boot-starter-test\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tasks.test {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    useJUnitPlatform()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"增量构建与构建缓存\">增量构建与构建缓存</h3><p>Gradle 的核心性能优势来自于增量构建和构建缓存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 增量编译：只重新编译变更的文件&#10;// Gradle 跟踪每个 Task 的输入和输出&#10;// 输入未变 → 跳过任务（UP-TO-DATE）&#10;&#10;// 构建缓存：跨构建复用任务输出&#10;// gradle.properties&#10;// org.gradle.caching=true&#10;&#10;// 配置缓存（Gradle 8+）：缓存配置阶段&#10;// org.gradle.configuration-cache=true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 增量编译：只重新编译变更的文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Gradle 跟踪每个 Task 的输入和输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 输入未变 → 跳过任务（UP-TO-DATE）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 构建缓存：跨构建复用任务输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// gradle.properties</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// org.gradle.caching=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 配置缓存（Gradle 8+）：缓存配置阶段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// org.gradle.configuration-cache=true</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化技术</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>加速倍数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>增量构建</td>\n<td>只处理变更的输入</td>\n<td>2-5x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建缓存</td>\n<td>复用历史构建输出</td>\n<td>3-10x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>守护进程</td>\n<td>JVM 保持运